          "kicker": "Women's international",
          "heading": "Fijiana Claim Inaugural World Rugby WXV Global Series Challenger Title",
          "body": "Fijiana have secured the inaugural World Rugby WXV Global Series Challenger title after a hard-fought 20-17 victory over the Netherlands. Despite challenging conditions at the Kai Tak Youth Sports Ground, Fiji finished top of the final tournament table. First-half tries from Merewairita Neivosa and Ivamere Nabura Rokowati provided the platform, before a composed penalty in the 80th minute sealed the trophy. The result cements a successful campaign, overcoming a late Dutch surge to finish the series ahead of Spain and the Netherlands."
        },
