          "body": "As the team prepares for the upcoming round of the Nations Championship, statistical records underline the recent competitiveness of the squad. France has held a position at the top of the world rankings for a period of one week, a feat achieved during the window of July 2022. Having secured two victories across their three fixtures in the current tournament, the side continues to build on their recent international performance following their 42-15 win over Japan."
