          "heading": "IRFU remains in discussions regarding potential Women’s League entry",
          "body": "The IRFU is continuing to assess the prospect of entering the British and Irish Women’s League, with no formal decision reached on what has been described as a massive opportunity for the union. While recent focus has been on the national side's WXV Global Series campaign, the potential structural shift for the women's game remains an open, unresolved storyline. The union is expected to provide further updates once internal deliberations concerning the future of the competition format are finalised."
